# Offline runtime and business demos and tests need no model credentials.
# ModelConfig.from_env() reads process environment variables only.
# MODEL: required model identifier for the selected service.
# API_KEY: required real-service credential; never commit its value.
# BASE_URL: optional Responses API service URL; otherwise use the SDK default.
# MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS: optional positive request timeout; default is 30 seconds.
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS: optional positive integer per request; default is 4096.
# REASONING_EFFORT: optional none/minimal/low/medium/high/xhigh/max/ultra.
# Accepted effort values depend on the selected model; omission uses its default.
# MAX_RUN_SECONDS: optional positive active run deadline; default is 180 seconds.
# This project does not automatically load .env files. Load explicitly with:
# uv run --locked --env-file .env python -m src.config
# The command above validates settings locally and never calls the model.
# API keys and full service URLs are omitted from public model_settings.
